        // ── complexity (speculative drafting): the copy window WIDTH is a
        // per-stream adaptive quantity driven by acceptance feedback, and
        // the ramp runs only while the stream runs alone ───────────────
        // Source: engine/lane_family.py (the ramp + the alone gate), the
